  "question": {
    "text": "Let \\(A B C\\) be a triangle formed by the lines \\(7 x-6 y+3=0, x+2 y-31=0\\) and \\(9 x-2 y-19=0\\). Let the point \\((h, k)\\) be the image of the centroid of \\(\\Delta A B C\\) in the line \\(3 x+6 y-53=0\\). Then \\(h^2+k^2+h k\\) is equal to:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
